NOTE ON THE RECOVERED CONTENT UNDER `site/`:

The HTML, images, and PDFs under `site/k0bg.com/` are recovered copies of
the late Alan Applegate's K0BG.COM website. The MIT license above applies
to the recovery scripts and methodology in this repository, NOT to Alan's
original authored content. That content remains the intellectual property of
Alan Applegate and his estate. This repository preserves it as a community
courtesy. If you are a rights holder and would like the recovered content
removed, please open an issue or contact the maintainer.
